  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><img src=\"https://warhammercraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/BannerNoUnofficial-1.png\" width=\"1110\" height=\"167\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">-</span><br></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><em>在Minecraft中一磚一瓦重建舊世界！</em></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">用於WarhammerCraft伺服器的模組合集，包含<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warhammercraft-aethyr\" rel=\"nofollow\">WarhammerCraft: Aethyr</a>自訂方塊模組。<br> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們致力於精確還原戰鎚奇幻宇宙中的舊世界大陸。<strong>WarhammerCraft</strong>伺服器是Minecraft中對戰鎚奇幻最完整的非官方重現！</span></span></h2>\n<h2><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">玩家可以飛翔觀賞我們的作品，或申請加入我們優秀的建築團隊。</span><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">無論您是戰鎚粉絲、喜愛在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmap.warhammercraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">廣大地圖</a>上建造宏偉城堡的建築愛好者，還是單純享受Minecraft的玩家，WarhammerCraft都歡迎您前來探索。</span></span></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://warhammercraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/LogoLarge.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"256\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>我們持續招募建築師加入！ |<em>&nbsp;</em></strong>前往下方官網，點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwarhammercraft.com%252fapplytobuild%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>申請加入建築</strong></a>即可加入。<br></span></h2>\n</div>\n</div><h2>&nbsp;</h2><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwarhammercraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>官方網站</strong></span></a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/warhammercraft_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">Twitter</span></strong></a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fwarhammercraft%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">Planet Minecraft</span></strong></a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252ff2dSs5R\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">Discord</span></strong></a></span></p>",
